{
  "info": {
    "name": "AutoGiro · Billing Service",
    "description": "Todas as rotas do AutoGiro · Billing Service, geradas a partir do OpenAPI do serviço (docs/openapi.json).\n\n`base_url`: localmente http://localhost:8002; no cluster, o endereço do Kong (http://<ip-do-nó>:30080), exceto as rotas de saúde e métricas, que não passam pelo gateway.\n`token`: JWT emitido pela Lambda autogiro-auth a partir do CPF.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8002"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "order_id",
      "value": "1"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/health",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "health"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Health",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Liveness",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/health/live",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "health",
                "live"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Liveness",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Readiness",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/health/ready",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "health",
                "ready"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Pronto para receber tráfego quando todas as dependências respondem.\n\nCada serviço registra suas verificações (banco, broker) em\n`app.state.readiness_checks`: um dicionário nome → função assíncrona que\ndevolve `True` quando a dependência está de pé.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Observabilidade",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Métricas no formato Prometheus",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/metrics",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "metrics"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Endpoint de scrape do Prometheus (agente do New Relic no cluster).",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Orçamentos",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Budget",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/budgets/{{order_id}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "budgets",
                "{{order_id}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Orçamento da OS, com os serviços e as peças."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Approve",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/budgets/{{order_id}}/approve",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "budgets",
                "{{order_id}}",
                "approve"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Aprova o orçamento e devolve o link de pagamento (Checkout Pro do Mercado Pago).\n\nSe o Mercado Pago não responder, devolve 502 e o orçamento continua pendente."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reject",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/budgets/{{order_id}}/reject",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "budgets",
                "{{order_id}}",
                "reject"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Recusa o orçamento: a Saga libera as peças e cancela a OS."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Pagamentos",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Payment",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/payments/{{order_id}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "payments",
                "{{order_id}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Get Payment"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Sync Payment",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/payments/{{order_id}}/sync",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "payments",
                "{{order_id}}",
                "sync"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Consulta o Mercado Pago agora, sem esperar o próximo ciclo de 15 s."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
